From 86effafe17181f2319531cb7795596f0d5f2f59b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anisetti Avinash Krishna <anisetti.avinash.krishna@intel.com>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 08:49:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Siso-compatible makefiles and toolchain updates

changes:
- core/definitions.mk: update IAFW_LIBCLANG path clang/19 -> clang/22 (folds in the
  former common/device/intel/build/0001 clang 19 -> 20 update)
  for A17 toolchain compatibility
- tasks/code_check.mk: convert warn_vendor_modules and
  warn_local_module_tags from bare .PHONY to marker-file targets
  for Siso dependency tracking
- tasks/flashfiles.mk: convert publish_vertical, check-vintf-all, and
  flashfiles to marker-file targets; fix tar commands to use explicit
  vertical_patches and vertical_keybox_provisioning paths instead of
  wildcards; add wrapper .PHONY flashfiles target for workspace root
- tasks/publish.mk: convert publish_mkdir_dest and
  publish_gptimage_var from .PHONY to marker-file targets for Siso
  compatibility

Tracked-On: NIACP3-1498
Signed-off-by: Anisetti Avinash Krishna <anisetti.avinash.krishna@intel.com>
---
 core/definitions.mk |  4 +-
 tasks/code_check.mk | 15 +++++--
 tasks/flashfiles.mk | 97 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--------
 tasks/publish.mk    | 28 +++++++++----
 4 files changed, 115 insertions(+), 29 deletions(-)

